</div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <a class="service-card" id="personal" href="/personal-banking"><span class="service-icon">↗</span><span class="service-number">01 / PERSONAL</span><h3>Personal Banking</h3><p>Everyday banking, savings and financial tools made to fit your life.</p><span class="text-link">Discover personal banking <b>→</b></span></a>
        <a class="service-card" id="business" href="/business-banking"><span class="service-icon">▥</span><span class="service-number">02 / BUSINESS</span><h3>Business Banking</h3><p>Flexible business accounts and services for your next stage of growth.</p><span class="text-link">Explore business solutions <b>→</b></span></a>
        <a class="service-card" id="global" href="/global-transfers"><span class="service-icon">◎</span><span class="service-number">03 / GLOBAL</span><h3>Global Transfers</h3><p>Move money across borders with clear information and secure workflows.</p><span class="text-link">Explore global banking <b>→</b></span></a>
        <a class="service-card" id="security" href="/security"><span class="service-icon">♢</span><span class="service-number">04 / SECURITY</span><h3>Security First</h3><p>Account safeguards, transaction alerts and support when you need it.</p><span class="text-link">How we protect you <b>→</b></span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

<!-- 360° rotating carousel (new only) -->
<section class="gtb-carousel-section" aria-label="Highlights">
  <div class="gtb-carousel-360" data-gtb-carousel-360>
    <div class="gtb-carousel-360__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">AROUND THE GLOBE</p>
      <h2>Banking that turns<br><em>with you</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gtb-carousel-360__stage">
      <div class="gtb-carousel-360__ring">
        <article class="gtb-carousel-360__card">
          <div class="gtb-carousel-360__icon" aria-hidden="true">P</div>
          <h3>Personal</h3>
          <p>Everyday accounts and cards designed for clarity and control.</p>
          <a href="/personal">Explore personal →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="gtb-carousel-360__card">
          <div class="gtb-carousel-360__icon" aria-hidden="true">B</div>
          <h3>Business</h3>
          <p>Flexible tools for the next stage of growth and cash flow.</p>
          <a href="/business">Explore business →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="gtb-carousel-360__card">
          <div class="gtb-carousel-360__icon" aria-hidden="true">G</div>
          <h3>Global</h3>
          <p>Cross-border transfers with clear information and secure flows.</p>
          <a href="/contact">Explore global →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="gtb-carousel-360__card">
          <div class="gtb-carousel-360__icon" aria-hidden="true">S</div>
          <h3>Security</h3>
          <p>Safeguards and alerts so you stay informed at every step.</p>
          <a href="/security">How we protect you →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gtb-carousel-360__controls">
      <button type="button" class="gtb-carousel-360__btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous">‹</button>
      <div class="gtb-carousel-360__dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Slides"></div>
      <button type="button" class="gtb-carousel-360__btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next">›</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

    <section class="global-section section-shell">
      <div class="global-visual">
        <div class="global-glow"></div><div class="global-grid"></div>
        <div class="global-copy"><p class="eyebrow light">YOUR WORLD, CONNECTED</p><h2>A global bank.<br><em>A local touch.</em></h2><p>Wherever life takes you, banking should move with you. Discover a more connected way to manage your financial world.</p><a class="button button-light" href="#global">Explore global banking <span>↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="global-mini-globe" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mini-globe-core">◎</div><span class="mini-orbit mini-orbit-1"></span><span class="mini-orbit mini-orbit-2"></span><span class="mini-orbit mini-orbit-3"></span><span class="mini-node node-1"></span><span class="mini-node node-2"></span><span class="mini-node node-3"></span></div>
        <div class="global-stats"><div><strong>Global reach</strong><span>Cross-border possibilities</span></div><div><strong>Multi-currency</strong><span>Designed for global lives</span></div><div><strong>Always connected</strong><span>Digital access, wherever available</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why-section section-shell" id="about">
      <div class="why-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE GLOBE TRUST DIFFERENCE</p><h2>Confidence in every<br><em>connection.</em></h2><p>Banking should feel clear, secure and personal. We're building an experience that puts your financial life first.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know us <b>→</b></a></div>
      <div class="why-list">
        <article class="why-item"><span class="why-icon">◎</span><div><h3>Global perspective</h3><p>Financial tools designed for people and businesses with international ambitions.</p></div><span class="why-arrow">↗</span></article>
        <article class="why-item"><span class="why-icon">♢</span><div><h3>Security at every step</h3><p>Thoughtful safeguards and clear account activity help you stay informed.</p></div><span class="why-arrow">↗</span></article>
        <article class="why-item"><span class="why-icon">◈</span><div><h3>Clear, considered service</h3><p>Simple digital experiences with support pathways when you need a person.</p></div><span class="why-arrow">↗</span></article>
        <article class="why-item"><span class="why-icon">◷</span><div><h3>Support that stays close</h3><p>Find answers and contact support through our available service channels.</p></div><span class="why-arrow">↗</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section section-shell" id="contact">
      <div class="cta-content"><p class="eyebrow light">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</p><h2>Make room for<br><em>what's possible.</em></h2><p>Take the next step towards a more connected banking experience.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/open-account">Open an Account <span>↗</span></a><a class="button button-ghost-light" href="/contact">Talk to our team</a></div></div>
      <div class="cta-seal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 200"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="88"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="72"/><ellipse cx="100" cy="100" rx="35" ry="72"/><path d="M28 100h144M100 28v144M49 49l102 102M151 49 49 151"/></svg><span>TRUST<br>THAT MOVES<br>WITH YOU</span></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <script defer src="/js/carousel.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
